**Known Failure Cases (for v6):**
1. Dark mode sites get no pruning (threshold assumes white bg)
2. Small elements (<500px) may be pruned away
3. Stitched image loses spatial context between blocks
4. Horizontal coordinate shift possible in merged blocks
5. Content-dense pages see <5% benefit
6. See `v3_known_failures.py` for full documentation